OL,3,GNEWSALorry driver who hit pedestrian   
OL,4,Atreated as witness                     
OL,6,FA lorry driver who fatally struck a    
OL,7,Fpedestrian on a motorway is now being  
OL,8,Ftreated as a witness, police have      
OL,9,Fconfirmed.                             
OL,11,FA man in his 40s died after being hit  
OL,12,Fby the HGV on the M55 near junction one
OL,13,Ffor Broughton on 11 November.          
OL,15,FThe lorry driver, a man, in his 30s,   
OL,16,Fwas arrested on suspicion of causing   
OL,17,Fdeath by dangerous driving and drug    
OL,18,Fdriving.                               
