OL,6,FLancashire Police said the driver was  
OL,7,Fnow no longer being investigated in    
OL,8,Fconnection with causing the man's      
OL,9,Fdeath, but remains under investigation 
OL,10,Ffor allegedly driving over the         
OL,11,Fprescribed drug limit.                 
